flowchart TD
    title Notification Routing Flow

    A[Event Received] --> B{Event Type?}
    B -->|Order Placed| C[Template: order_confirmation]
    B -->|Payment Failed| D[Template: payment_failed]
    B -->|Item Shipped| E[Template: shipping_update]
    B -->|Refund Processed| F[Template: refund_receipt]
    B -->|Low Stock| G[Template: low_stock_admin]

    C --> H[Load User Preferences]
    D --> H
    E --> H
    F --> H
    G --> H

    H --> I{Channel Preference?}
    I -->|Email| J[Send via Email Service]
    I -->|Push| K[Send via Push Service]
    I -->|SMS| L[Send via SMS Service]
    I -->|All| M[Send via All Channels]

    J --> N[Log Delivery Status]
    K --> N
    L --> N
    M --> N

    N --> O{Delivery Success?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Mark as Delivered]
    O -->|No| Q{Retry Count < 3?}
    Q -->|Yes| R[Queue for Retry]
    R --> S[Wait Backoff Period]
    S --> I
    Q -->|No| T[Mark as Failed]
    T --> U[Log Failure]
